*   **K-Quant Boosts:** Optimized VDR (Vectorized Dot Product) paths for Q4_K, Q5_K, Q6_K, and Q8_0, including a dedicated parameter table for RDNA3.5.
*   **Hybrid All-Reduce (Block 12):** Custom internal all-reduce1.02.091.340 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =    623, tg =  33.96 t/s, tg_3s =  35.69 t/s
